{"posts":[{"id":"jurij_p4_1","t":"Nice setup gif.. might be a good idea next time to use gif file for my trade setup :P","a":"claudiuschan","d":"03 Mar 2016 22:57","r":"Trader","n":"#1","p":4,"im":[],"fa":"گیف ستاپ خوبی بود… شاید دفعهٔ بعد ایدهٔ خوبی باشد که برای ستاپ معامله‌ام از فایل گیف استفاده کنم :P","m":50108},{"id":"jurij_p4_2","t":"Working on flag limits...\n\nI think I've also found the reason for some failed engulfs when looking from this perspective. But not sure yet.\n\nIt seems that engulfs that happen on S/R levels tend to fail because often S/R levels are the limits of broken flags...","a":"Jurij","d":"07 Mar 2016 20:45","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#2","p":4,"im":["38309fe84c6ebff927297a84a72b4990dd34d316","80082d264da55274a5948b12bf993f8f3b291658"],"fa":"دارم روی فلگ‌لیمیت‌ها کار می‌کنم…\n\nفکر می‌کنم از این زاویه دلیل بعضی اینگالف‌های شکست‌خورده را هم پیدا کرده‌ام. اما هنوز مطمئن نیستم.\n\nبه نظر می‌رسد اینگالف‌هایی که روی سطوح S/R رخ می‌دهند بیشتر شکست می‌خورند، چون غالباً همین سطوح، فلگ‌لیمیت فلگ‌های شکسته‌اند…","ib":{"38309fe84c6ebff927297a84a72b4990dd34d316":1,"80082d264da55274a5948b12bf993f8f3b291658":3},"m":50165},{"id":"jurij_p4_3","t":"","a":"Jurij","d":"08 Mar 2016 01:43","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#3","p":4,"im":["d15ad2da7d58e58b175526ef2155d831609cbda5"],"ib":{"d15ad2da7d58e58b175526ef2155d831609cbda5":0},"m":50167},{"id":"jurij_p4_4","t":"Jurij wrote: Working on flag limits...\n\nI think I've also found the reason for some failed engulfs when looking from this perspective. But not sure yet.\n\nIt seems that engulfs that happen on S/R levels tend to fail because often S/R levels are the limits of broken flags...","a":"Jurij","d":"08 Mar 2016 02:17","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#4","p":4,"im":["c923055e591751b5ca108195035285611c3f26ae","be77764ffd8d5f5fe6dfb7544ace46b1d3e79dd0"],"fa":"Jurij نوشت: دارم روی فلگ‌لیمیت‌ها کار می‌کنم…\n\nفکر می‌کنم از این زاویه دلیل بعضی اینگالف‌های شکست‌خورده را هم پیدا کرده‌ام. اما هنوز مطمئن نیستم.\n\nبه نظر می‌رسد اینگالف‌هایی که روی سطوح S/R رخ می‌دهند بیشتر شکست می‌خورند، چون غالباً همین سطوح، فلگ‌لیمیت فلگ‌های شکسته‌اند…","ib":{"c923055e591751b5ca108195035285611c3f26ae":3,"be77764ffd8d5f5fe6dfb7544ace46b1d3e79dd0":3},"m":50169,"q":[{"p":"jurij_p4_2","a":"Jurij","x":"Working on flag limits... I think I've also found the reason for some failed engulfs when looking from this perspective. But not sure yet. It seems that engulfs that happen on S/R …"}]},{"id":"jurij_p4_5","t":"","a":"Jurij","d":"08 Mar 2016 21:13","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#5","p":4,"im":["e48421dabaf7590bff721a30029899dced85fb9f"],"ib":{"e48421dabaf7590bff721a30029899dced85fb9f":0},"m":50180},{"id":"jurij_p4_6","t":"","a":"Jurij","d":"09 Mar 2016 01:01","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#6","p":4,"im":["ebb69507893a4d534cb7a93e8a6adf9030f8d6fb"],"ib":{"ebb69507893a4d534cb7a93e8a6adf9030f8d6fb":0},"m":50182},{"id":"jurij_p4_7","t":"I think this one failed because price entered the CP PAZ. Or maybe\nbecause price reached almost the next flag during the engulf/FO. Not\nsure.","a":"Jurij","d":"09 Mar 2016 01:11","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#7","p":4,"im":["33f726c0b925fb18162613b5ad13fc22f18ee8a9"],"fa":"فکر می‌کنم این یکی شکست خورد چون قیمت وارد PAZ مربوط به CP شد. یا شاید هم در جریان اینگالف/FO تقریباً به فلگ بعدی رسیده بود. مطمئن نیستم.","ib":{"33f726c0b925fb18162613b5ad13fc22f18ee8a9":1},"m":50183},{"id":"jurij_p4_8","t":"Hey Jurij, this one looks like a tough one to me, but i see a couple\nof things would make me hesitant to go long. First there was no HH\nengulf on the major swing. Next your entry signal looks to be part of a\nlarger PAZ that didn't get engulfed (these I always find tough to\ndraw). Finally right around where you entered you have the engulf down\n(which could have been a fakeout) and no engulf breaking up at the end\nof that compression.","a":"ahdat","d":"09 Mar 2016 15:23","r":"Trader","n":"#8","p":4,"im":["39db23ac413d4a4cbb54f71cc9a7ca2d5459ec3b"],"fa":"سلام Jurij، این یکی برای من سخت است، اما چند چیز می‌بینم که مرا در خرید مردد می‌کند. اول این‌که روی سوئینگ اصلی هیچ اینگالف HH نبود. بعد سیگنال ورودت ظاهراً جزئی از یک PAZ بزرگ‌تر است که اینگالف نشد (رسم این‌ها همیشه برایم دشوار است). در آخر هم دقیقاً همان‌جا که وارد شدی، اینگالف نزولی داری (که می‌توانسته فیک‌اوت باشد) و هیچ اینگالفی که در پایان آن فشردگی رو به بالا را بشکند نداری.","ib":{"39db23ac413d4a4cbb54f71cc9a7ca2d5459ec3b":1},"m":50187},{"id":"jurij_p4_9","t":"ahdat, yes if you consider distinct PA zones, then this is what I see\n\nThanks for your view","a":"Jurij","d":"09 Mar 2016 17:40","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#9","p":4,"im":["bcf2178627001980ef60f901faafe38d42cecdda"],"fa":"ahdat، بله اگر ناحیه‌های PA را جدا در نظر بگیری، چیزی که می‌بینم این است\n\nممنون از دیدگاهت","ib":{"bcf2178627001980ef60f901faafe38d42cecdda":1},"m":50191},{"id":"jurij_p4_10","t":"Order not filled, but still interesting\n\nUSDJPY 5m\n\nWhy my entry was there:\n\nUSDJPY 1m\n\nWhy it was not filled:","a":"Jurij","d":"10 Mar 2016 17:59","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#10","p":4,"im":["4e186bdf6605aede2d63c20cd1ff3eaa0a337e62","b3b0c608bb5a9e4cad2ad93875bff62fc7fdf993","19b86849e17653a09e72a2f5f72f95aa114dbe45","fc3b5cb46e8591df6114696f27e20a4779b5b2b3"],"fa":"سفارش پر نشد، اما هنوز جالب است\n\nUSDJPY 5m\n\nچرا ورودم آن‌جا بود:\n\nUSDJPY 1m\n\nچرا پر نشد:","ib":{"4e186bdf6605aede2d63c20cd1ff3eaa0a337e62":2,"b3b0c608bb5a9e4cad2ad93875bff62fc7fdf993":3,"19b86849e17653a09e72a2f5f72f95aa114dbe45":5,"fc3b5cb46e8591df6114696f27e20a4779b5b2b3":5},"m":50208},{"id":"jurij_p4_11","t":"There is only one playing field, the one made up by ITs.\n\nWhat I mean, there's no range/trend or other \"choppy\" market conditions, only the right scale.\n\nWhen the market trends (nothing to the left) then ITs are driving price\non the HTF playing field, likeweise range/chop creates the LTF field.\n\nEU 5m (wrong annotation saying 15m, please ignore)\n\nEU 1H","a":"Jurij","d":"11 Mar 2016 03:21","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#11","p":4,"im":["838b33a18bb4c7fdd2921c9d474bd1c0e882e57b","a9800cb70adf564da271f4039bf55b49e0e8d907"],"fa":"فقط یک زمین بازی وجود دارد، همانی که IT‌ها ساخته‌اند.\n\nمنظورم این است که «رنج/روند» یا شرایط «پرنوسان» دیگری وجود ندارد؛ فقط مقیاس درست وجود دارد.\n\nوقتی بازار روند دارد (چیزی در سمت چپ نیست)، IT‌ها قیمت را در زمین بازی HTF می‌رانند؛ به همین شکل رنج/چاپ زمین LTF را می‌سازد.\n\nEU 5m (یادداشت اشتباهی که 15m نوشته، لطفاً نادیده بگیر)\n\nEU 1H","ib":{"838b33a18bb4c7fdd2921c9d474bd1c0e882e57b":4,"a9800cb70adf564da271f4039bf55b49e0e8d907":5},"m":50214},{"id":"jurij_p4_12","t":"Spread","a":"Jurij","d":"11 Mar 2016 19:49","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#12","p":4,"im":["dd4055af81bc98691dceb80d9d6d5a7bde85b480","48bbffbfbfb39d146c5eca972065d2403c674df1"],"fa":"اسپرد","ib":{"dd4055af81bc98691dceb80d9d6d5a7bde85b480":1,"48bbffbfbfb39d146c5eca972065d2403c674df1":1},"m":50219},{"id":"jurij_p4_13","t":"Psychology of stop hunting","a":"Jurij","d":"13 Mar 2016 00:05","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#13","p":4,"im":["f549d8493e25c148e7dbaf0119deed30ec2b9e72"],"fa":"روان‌شناسی شکار حد ضرر","ib":{"f549d8493e25c148e7dbaf0119deed30ec2b9e72":1},"m":50234},{"id":"jurij_p4_14","t":"Lately many things are starting to click for me","a":"Jurij","d":"14 Mar 2016 16:55","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#14","p":4,"im":["38eb046e768fdc77694b0b2cd532918cd961a2d1"],"fa":"اخیراً چیزهای زیادی برایم جا می‌افتد","ib":{"38eb046e768fdc77694b0b2cd532918cd961a2d1":1},"m":50253},{"id":"jurij_p4_15","t":"Original target was a bit more down but the PA made me exit sooner.","a":"Jurij","d":"16 Mar 2016 21:18","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#15","p":4,"im":["81b80e3e4e27e70a5ee19c716803bca30e8a9dbf"],"fa":"تارگت اصلی کمی پایین‌تر بود، اما PA باعث شد زودتر خارج شوم.","ib":{"81b80e3e4e27e70a5ee19c716803bca30e8a9dbf":0},"m":50284},{"id":"jurij_p4_16","t":"Not the best entry\n\nthe compression up did concern me, so target was the first clear FTR","a":"Jurij","d":"16 Mar 2016 23:58","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#16","p":4,"im":["4a224d